  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Impossible. No human should have survived the previous challenge unless\u2026
    you\u2019ve altered the course parameters."
  - "It doesn\u2019t matter. This next galaxy is even more hazardous: neutron stars
    with magnetic fields capable of manipulating your ball\u2019s trajectory."
  - "And this time, I\u2019ll be monitoring every movement. No more leniency."
